This directory intentionally contains no client.json.

Activation sequence:
1. Copy a private, locally generated client.json here and set mode 0600.
2. Run: /etc/init.d/xrayebator-safe check
3. Run: xrayebator-safe-activate 90
4. Verify router access, DNS, HTTPS, tunnel egress and fail-closed behavior.
5. Run: xrayebator-safe-commit

If checks fail or the router becomes unreachable, wait for automatic rollback.
Manual rollback: xrayebator-safe-rollback
